[00:00.00][by:kalanokyougai]
[00:00.74]Spent most of last night dragging this lake
[00:00.74]昨晚花了大半夜踱步在湖畔
[00:04.26]For the corpses of all my past mistakes
[00:04.26]只为了回想往昔旧错的残片
[00:08.24]Sell me out, the jokes on you
[00:08.24]背叛我，而你则是出丑的那个
[00:10.25]We are salt and you are the wound
[00:10.25]我是盐而你是伤口
[00:16.28]Empty another bottle and let me tear you to pieces
[00:16.28]又灌了一瓶酒，让我把与你的回忆撕成碎片
[00:20.11]This is me wishing you into the worst situations
[00:20.11]这是我所设想的与你最坏的结局
[00:24.17]I'm the kind of kid that can't let anything go
[00:24.17]我是那种不能释怀的人
[00:28.50]So you wouldn't know a good thing if it came up and slit your throat
[00:28.50]所以你不会明白，当往昔的美好再次浮现时会有多么撕心裂肺
[00:48.26]Your remorse hasn't fallen on deaf ears, rather ones that just don't care
[00:48.26]你的忏悔我并非置若罔闻，但我更想我能置之不理
[00:53.22]'Cause I know that you're in between arms somewhere
[00:53.22]因为我知道此刻的你应该在别的男人的怀抱里了
[00:57.14]Next to heartbeats where you shouldn't dare sleep
[00:57.14]躺在那个你本不能安然入眠的男人边上
[01:00.23]Now I'll teach you a lesson for keeping secrets from me
[01:00.23]现在让我来教教你该如何向我隐瞒秘密
[01:04.22]Take your taste back, peel back your skin
[01:04.22]收起你丑陋的嗜好，揭开你肮脏的外表
[01:11.80]And try to forget how it feels inside
[01:11.80]试着忘记你内心不堪的想法
[01:15.23]You should try saying no once in a while
[01:15.23]哦对了，有时你也该试着说不
[01:18.76]Oh, once in while
[01:18.76]呵呵
[01:20.26]Take your taste back, peel back your skin
[01:20.26]收起你丑陋的嗜好，揭开你肮脏的外表
[01:27.85]And try to forget how it feels inside
[01:27.85]试着忘记你内心不堪的想法
[01:31.20]You should try saying no once in a while
[01:31.20]哦对了，有时你也该试着说不
[01:34.71]Oh, once in while
[01:34.71]呵呵
[01:36.30]And did you hear the news?
[01:36.30]对了，你有听到消息吗？
[01:38.83]I could dissect you and gut you on this stage
[01:38.83]我可以完全看穿你并把你的本质大白于世
[01:42.26]Not as eloquent as I may have imagined
[01:42.26]虽然不及我所想象的那般具有说服力
[01:45.49]But it will get the job done, you're done
[01:45.49]但我会做好我的本分，到时你也就完了
[01:52.28]Every line is plotted and designed
[01:52.28]该走的路我已经规划好了
[01:55.78]To leave you standing on your bedroom window's ledge
[01:55.78]就是为了让你曝光在光天化日之下
[02:00.72]And everyone else that it hits, that it gets to
[02:00.72]就算其他人抨击你
[02:04.88]Is nothing more than collateral damage
[02:04.88]我所获得的也不过是间接伤害
